## Project Structure

```
Assets/
├── Resources/
│   └── DoofusDiary.json      # Game config (speed, pulpit timing)
├── Scripts/
│   ├── ConfigLoader.cs       # Loads & validates JSON config
│   ├── DoofusDiary.cs        # JSON data model
│   ├── DoofusController.cs   # Player movement, fall detection
│   ├── Pulpit.cs             # Individual platform: timer, fade, scoring trigger
│   ├── PulpitSpawner.cs      # Spawn logic, adjacency, max-2 rule, platform-assist
│   ├── ScoreManager.cs       # Score tracking, win-condition check
│   ├── ScoreUI.cs            # Live score display + pop animation
│   ├── GameManager.cs        # Game state machine (Start/Playing/GameOver/Won)
│   ├── GameUIManager.cs      # Panel show/hide logic per game state
│   ├── CameraFollow.cs       # Smooth camera tracking
│   └── MusicToggle.cs        # Background music mute toggle
├── Prefabs/
│   └── Pulpit.prefab
├── Materials/
└── Scenes/
    └── SampleScene.unity
```

